### 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "tomori_fan", "password": "abc12345", "nickname": "灯厨"}

### 重复注册（再发一次同样的请求）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "tomori_fan", "password": "abc12345"}

### 弱密码（应报 40001）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "anon", "password": "123"}
